  "method": "Train the independent phrase encoder and decoder on train rows with query-independent full-phrase reconstruction. Apply fixed-scale fake quantization after latent normalization and before decoding, using an identity straight-through gradient. Then decode the quantized codes to token IDs and train PBSLM on query loss only.",
  "storage_accounting": "Payload assumes signed bit-packed values with a fixed scale and no per-vector scale metadata. The decoder is shared model state and excluded from per-example bytes.",
  "limitations": "Synthetic task with ordered x/y segmentation and held-out ordered value pairs. The source token embeddings are frozen random initialization. The thinking trunk receives decoder-expanded token IDs, so this does not test direct reasoning on latent vectors.",
